{%- comment -%}
  The theme's own media for a product, from one list (the home chapters,
  the product page, product cards and About all read it).

  Outputs "film|short|looks":
    film   asset base name of the product's film (assets/<film>.mp4 and
           assets/<film>-poster.webp), or empty
    short  short name used by its lookbook images
    looks  number of lookbook images: assets/look-<short>-1.webp … -<looks>.webp

  Usage:
    {%- capture media -%}{% render 'film-name', handle: product.handle %}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign media = media | strip | split: '|' -%}
    media[0] film · media[1] short · media[2] looks
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Only media that shows the piece as it really is. Films and photographs
  that showed another shape, colour or detail were removed (Margaux,
  Bennett, Everett, Rowan, Varen, Soren, Arden, Heart, F360).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  case handle
    when 'valeria-leather-shoulder-bag'
      echo 'film-valeria|valeria|4'
    when 'isadora-leather-shoulder-bag'
      echo 'film-isadora|isadora|4'
    when 'amelie-suede-leather-tote-bag'
      echo 'film-amelie|amelie|4'
    when 'margaux-suede-leather-tote-bag'
      echo '|margaux|4'
    when 'evelin-leather-bag'
      echo 'film-evelin|evelin|4'
    when 'odette-leather-tote-bag'
      echo 'film-odette|odette|4'
    when 'lucienne-leather-shoulder-bag'
      echo 'film-lucienne|lucienne|4'
    when 'vivienne-suede-leather-shoulder-bag'
      echo 'film-vivienne|vivienne|4'
    when 'elara-leather-bag'
      echo 'film-elara|elara|4'
    when 'alicia-leather-handbag'
      echo 'film-alicia|alicia|4'
    when 'celeste-leather-handbag'
      echo 'film-celeste|celeste|4'
    when 'alden-leather-clutch-bag'
      echo 'film-alden|alden|4'
    when 'marlow-leather-clutch-bag'
      echo '|marlow|4'
    when 'wellington-leather-business-briefcase'
      echo 'film-wellington|wellington|4'
    when 'bennett-leather-zip-wallet'
      echo '|bennett|0'
    when 'everett-leather-zip-wallet'
      echo '|everett|3'
    when 'conrad-leather-wallet'
